Kickolé realistic assets
========================

kickole_player_v4.glb, kickole_player_v4_lod1.glb,
kickole_player_v4_female.glb and kickole_player_v4_female_lod1.glb
---------------------------------------------------------------------
These four files are optimised game models derived from two realistic
footballers bought on Fab.

  Licence:     Fab Standard License, Personal tier
  Licensee:    Rob Stancombe t/a IQ Apps Group
  Artist:      artistofthemonth
  Male source: the 21,071-triangle model with the Godot humanoid rig
               (84 bones in the download; reduced to the game contract)
  Female source: the 29,085-triangle model with the normal FBX rig

The optimised GLBs may ship inside the Kickolé app and the web build.
The raw purchased source (zips, FBX, blend, and the unpacked textures)
must not be redistributed and is not in this repository.

Rebuild with `npm run build:player`. The script expects the download at
`FAB_PLAYER_SRC` (default `/cursor/stores/bot/kickole-fab-models`),
containing `source_4.zip` (male) and `source.zip` (female). It writes only
the four GLBs above. Do not commit the Fab download.

Both bodies share the skeleton and clip contract in `docs/CHARACTER_GLB.md`.
Fingers, twist bones and face bones are merged into at most 20 joints.
The clips (Idle, KickLeft, KickRight, Miss, Celebrate) are original and
sampled from the game pose. Kit colours and the chest number are applied
at runtime. No club, league or real-player likeness is included. Both
bodies are free in the game.

